+- Only managers may freeze a project (other roles, and org admins without a role → 403). Freezing sets every member's role to `viewer`, including managers, so afterwards nobody can change the project's tasks (403). Freezing does not change any task, so a task may keep an assignee who is now a viewer. Freezing again is 403, since no manager is left. Freezing an archived project → 409.
